{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哈巴谷書","commonName":"哈巴谷書","title":"哈巴谷書","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3c3e2b7bc14d031520976fbe0e4ab846e36d1c515a15d75553ad38a39daf7e2e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["先知哈巴谷所得的默示。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷為不公平而訴苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"他說：耶和華啊！我呼求你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不應允，要到幾時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因強暴哀求你，你還不拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何使我看見罪孽？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何看着奸惡而不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毀滅和強暴在我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又起了爭端和相鬥的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此律法放鬆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公理也不顯明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人圍困義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以公理顯然顛倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的回答"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：你們要向列國中觀看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大大驚奇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為在你們的時候，我行一件事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖有人告訴你們，你們總是不信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必興起迦勒底人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是那殘忍暴躁之民，通行遍地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佔據那不屬自己的住處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他威武可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"判斷和勢力都任意發出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"他的馬比豹更快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比晚上的豺狼更猛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"馬兵踴躍爭先，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都從遠方而來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們飛跑如鷹抓食，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都為行強暴而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"定住臉面向前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將擄掠的人聚集，多如塵沙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們譏誚君王，笑話首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嗤笑一切保障，築壘攻取。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以自己的勢力為神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像風猛然掃過，顯為有罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷又向耶和華訴苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華－我的上帝，我的聖者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不是從亙古而有嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們必不致死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你派定他為要刑罰人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石啊，你設立他為要懲治人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你眼目清潔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不看邪僻，不看奸惡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行詭詐的，你為何看着不理呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人吞滅比自己公義的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何靜默不語呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你為何使人如海中的魚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如沒有管轄的爬物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他用鉤鉤住，用網捕獲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用拉網聚集他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他歡喜快樂，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就向網獻祭，向網燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他由此得肥美的分和富裕的食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他豈可屢次倒空網羅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將列國的人時常殺戮，毫不顧惜呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HAB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NAM/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}